{"thread":{"threadID":3052,"boardID":121,"topic":"Nächste Adminbesprechung?","time":1445001146,"userID":1758,"username":"Sexy Vengeance","lastPostTime":1446401557,"lastPoster":"Sexy Vengeance","replies":15,"views":170,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":0},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":38820,"threadID":3052,"userID":1758,"username":"Sexy Vengeance","subject":"Nächste Adminbesprechung?","time":1445001146,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hallo Jungs und Mädels,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>da wir beim letzten Mal keinen neuen Termin für die nächste Adminsitzung festegelt haben, wollte ich mich mal erkundigen wie&#x27;s denn so steht.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ich werfe einfach mal das Datum des 25.10 oder 01.11 in den Raum, wäre schön wenn man sich einigen könnte, wann denn die nächste stattfindet.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":38823,"threadID":3052,"userID":1952,"username":"Senpai","subject":"","time":1445002300,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Vote 4 25.10</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":38825,"threadID":3052,"userID":1563,"username":"aPex.","subject":"","time":1445004499,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>25er wäre super <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":38826,"threadID":3052,"userID":1902,"username":"Sutitchi","subject":"","time":1445004724,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich wäre für den 1.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":38827,"threadID":3052,"userID":null,"username":"Gery","subject":"","time":1445005498,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Please Vote!<br><a href=\"http://doodle.com/poll/wuz62wa6s7nunqzh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a><br><br>Wir machend sie dann, wenn am meisten kommen können. </p>","polls":[]},{"postID":39771,"threadID":3052,"userID":1902,"username":"Sutitchi","subject":"","time":1446228631,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Was ist denn jetzt nun eigentlich damit? Findet diesen Sonntag eine statt, finden nächsten eine statt oder findet überhaupt noch eine statt?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":39772,"threadID":3052,"userID":null,"username":"Baumi","subject":"","time":1446230427,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich wäre für diesen Sonntag.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":39773,"threadID":3052,"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","subject":"","time":1446230763,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Vote 4 Übermorgen.<br>01.11.2015</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":39774,"threadID":3052,"userID":1758,"username":"Sexy Vengeance","subject":"","time":1446231554,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>+1 1.11.2015</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":39775,"threadID":3052,"userID":1902,"username":"Sutitchi","subject":"","time":1446231945,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Gab doch &gt;Gerys Abstimmung <span class=\"missing-media\">[^^]</span> Aber bleibt ja tzrd die Frage ob nu überhaupt eine stattfindet</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":39776,"threadID":3052,"userID":1904,"username":"MaDNeZ","subject":"","time":1446234779,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>kann am 1.11 nicht (familientreffen)</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":39795,"threadID":3052,"userID":1948,"username":"neoNneoN","subject":"","time":1446373962,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ja wie siehts jz aus?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":39802,"threadID":3052,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1446398612,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Gute Frage, Uhrzeit wurde auch nicht angegeben. 20:30 wäre für mich passend.<br>Ich wäre da, wenn heute auch was stattfindet, also die Führung und andere Admins da sind. Wenn nur ein paar Leute und keine Führung da ist, dann komme ich ebenfalls nicht.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":39803,"threadID":3052,"userID":1948,"username":"neoNneoN","subject":"","time":1446401036,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ebenfalls.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":39804,"threadID":3052,"userID":1758,"username":"Sexy Vengeance","subject":"","time":1446401132,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Es liegt nicht an uns, ob die Leitung anwesend ist. Ich wäre auch dafür, dass heute eine veranstaltet wird.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Wobei es sich nächste Woche auch anbieten würde. Soviel ich weiß geht <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1852-vinceg/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@VinceG</a> gerade durch die Admins durch und befragt sie zur aktuellen Situation auf DREAM. Bis nächste Woche ist er sicherlich fertig.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ich werde einen neuen Thread erstellen mit einer Umfrage. Würde euch alle bitten, an der Umfrage teilzunehmen.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":39805,"threadID":3052,"userID":1758,"username":"Sexy Vengeance","subject":"","time":1446401557,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Kann keine Umfragen im Admin Topic starten ( <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1-sky/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Sky</a>, fix pls ) .</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Ich bin einfach mal so dreist und lege hiermit eine Adminsitzung für Sonntag, den 08.11.2015 um 20:00 fest.<br>Sonst wird das nie was.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Möchte auch nicht wissen, wer kann und wer nicht. Wer da ist, ist da.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Guten Abend noch</p>","polls":[]}]}